	<string id="pf_ph_boot_help_title"><text>+-- root@pda-recovery:/# man pda-hack </text></string>
	<string id="pf_ph_boot_help_subtitle"><text>tty help: mouse events run commands; no manual input required.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_ph_boot_help_body"><text>\n# OBJECTIVE\n  Recover 100% of data before all payloads are consumed.\n\n# WORKFLOW\n  01 | select a BOOT PAYLOAD on the left\n  02 | click [RUN] beside the required command\n  03 | the command runs immediately and consumes the payload\n\n# CORE OPERATIONS\n  DECRYPT / WEAKEN | data and protection\n  RESCAN / RECOVER | payloads and action points\n  BRUTE / EXTRACT  | instant success or money\n  SKELETON-KEY     | success with a small psi hit\n\n# CACHE INTERCEPTS\n  WEAKEN raises PURPLE / LEGENDARY / RED chances\n  percent = current chance; [-N] = action-point cost</text></string>
	<string id="pf_ph_boot_help_footer"><text>+-- [ESC] close </text></string>
